<a id="SortedSet"></a>
## `SortedSet`

```sisu
pub struct SortedSet[T: Ord]
    items: list[T]

impl[T: Ord] Len for SortedSet[T]
impl[T: Ord] Contains[T] for SortedSet[T]
```

A set whose values are kept in order (11's B-tree set; stage 0's is a
sorted list, searched by halves): `values` goes from the smallest up.

```sisu
var s: SortedSet[str] = SortedSet.new()
assert s.insert("pear")
assert s.insert("apple")
assert not s.insert("pear")
assert s.values() == ["apple", "pear"]
assert s.contains("apple") and not s.contains("fig")
assert s.remove("apple")
assert len(s) == 1
```

