```

The largest value, or `None`.

```sisu
var s: SortedSet[int] = SortedSet.new()
for x in [5, 1, 9]:
    _ = s.insert(x)
assert s.last().copied() == Some(9)
assert s.first().copied() == Some(1)
```

<a id="SortedSet.range"></a>
### `SortedSet.range`

```sisu
pub pure def range(self, low: T, high: T) -> list[T] where T: Copy
```

The values from `low` (included) up to `high` (left out), smallest
first.

```sisu
var s: SortedSet[int] = SortedSet.new()
for x in [1, 3, 5, 7, 9]:
    _ = s.insert(x)
assert s.range(3, 8) == [3, 5, 7]
```

